{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goals &amp; Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as Flavio or Mimi in <strong>single-player or local co-op</strong>. Face intense <strong>boss fights</strong>, fast-paced run &amp; gun levels, and challenging survival modes. Manage your resources in a <strong>mini tycoon-style</strong> workshop and <strong>upgrade your gear,</strong> including bullet types, charms, and melee weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new power abilities with Karma Points, earned by completing quests. Choose whether to help others or act selfishly for your own gain, your decisions shape your destiny as you travel through time in the cross-dimensional Circus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/extras/7f49e391b6ddb56c6f1647a66cae1a46.poster.avif?t=1762223957\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/extras/7f49e391b6ddb56c6f1647a66cae1a46.webm?t=1762223957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Flavio awakens in a strange place, surrounded by the ruins of a vast circus. Fragments of memories rush through his mind, unclear, distant. Discover what happened, why he\u2019s there, and how to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil creatures lurk in every corner. Freedom feels like a forgotten dream. Who rules this place remains a mystery, but <strong>magic and portals</strong> abound, leading to different eras and worlds. Face countless challenges and uncover the truth behind the Circus to find your way back home. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every battle demands preparation, gather and upgrade powerful equipment through exploration and the shop:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 Different bullet types (Shooter).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 Unique charms that grants or improve extra abilities (Charmer).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 Different Melee weapons (Hitter).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 Special Powers (Power).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/extras/5119c4a031c3ba6e627f3f2bcdea5f53.poster.avif?t=1762223957\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/extras/5119c4a031c3ba6e627f3f2bcdea5f53.webm?t=1762223957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/extras/5119c4a031c3ba6e627f3f2bcdea5f53.mp4?t=1762223957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Quests, currency &amp; Karma point system:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In the Circus, Souls serve as currency, used in both the shop and the workshop. However, your choices in how you earn and spend them affect your Karma Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Karma defines your reputation across the Circus. Positive or negative Karma influences how others treat you and determines the special rewards you can unlock from the Karma Tester Machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests can be found throughout the Circus, helping those in need may not directly aid Flavio\u2019s escape, but brings valuable rewards and good Karma.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Workshop:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each part of the Circus hides a magical workshop. Build your own manual or automatic machines to gather resources and produce Souls. Use them as you wish, for survival, power, or social reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/extras/232db0208492fbafec13923870a34188.poster.avif?t=1762223957\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/extras/232db0208492fbafec13923870a34188.webm?t=1762223957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/extras/232db0208492fbafec13923870a34188.mp4?t=1762223957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127510?t=1762223957","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/b6af161a04360a485e93d3350ee0a1ea15badc60/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762223957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/9c3c28f850943ce5ba28105c88845a3fb25d4476/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762223957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/9c3c28f850943ce5ba28105c88845a3fb25d4476/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762223957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_