957","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/540e9e565f0572dcdaf1cd3fa18b1426e7f397a3/ss_540e9e565f0572dcdaf1cd3fa18b1426e7f397a3.600x338.jpg?t=1762223957"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/90e34c7c0c8866567bda8a2c44ea744133b9cbc4/ss_90e34c7c0c8866567bda8a2c44ea744133b9cbc4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762223957","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127510/90e34c7c0c8866567bda8a2c44ea744133b9cbc4/ss_90e34c7c0c8866567bda8a2c44ea744133b9cbc4.600x338.jpg?t=1762223957"}],"short_description":"A challenging Boss fights focused action game, briefly called a 2D Souls-Like, featuring additional modes like Run &amp; Gun and Survival. Grow your resources in a mini tycoon-style workshop and upgrade your equipment in the shop to guide Flavio through these challenging battles!","steam_appid":4127510,"support_info":{"email":"support@flaviotheghostclown.com","url":"https://flaviotheghostclown.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Catalan<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://flaviotheghostclown.com"}